  "prefLabel": "He-P 4043.12 Bomb Detection RGDs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4043.12 Bomb Detection RGDs. In addition to the general requirements in He-P 4043.05, not otherwise exempted under He-P 4043.04(a), the following requirements in this section shall apply to bomb detection radiation equipment:\n\n(a) When not in use, each bomb detection radiation machine shall be locked to prevent unauthorized use;\n\n(b) The registrant shall maintain for each bomb detection radiation machine a utilization log. This log shall record the description of the unit, the date removed from storage, the date returned to storage, the identity and signature of the person to whom the device is assigned, the dates of use, and the site(s) of use; and\n\n(c) The registrant shall provide security to prevent entry by individuals from any point when the machine is energized during training.\n\nSource. #14336, eff 8-8-25, EXPIRES: 8-8-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p4040-4061.html"
